## Command

```shell
biome lint '<TEMP_DIR>/css_globals_follow_nested_configurations/src/Root.jsx' '<TEMP_DIR>/css_globals_follow_nested_configurations/nested/src/Nested.jsx' '<TEMP_DIR>/css_globals_follow_nested_configurations/combined/src/Combined.jsx'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "css": { "globals": ["src/root.css"] },
  "linter": {
    "rules": { "nursery": { "noUndeclaredClasses": "error" } }
  }
}
```

## `combined/biome.json`

```json
{
  "root": false,
  "extends": "//",
  "css": { "globals": ["src/combined.css"] }
}
```

## `nested/biome.json`

```json
{
  "root": false,
  "css": { "globals": ["src/nested.css"] },
  "linter": {
    "rules": { "nursery": { "noUndeclaredClasses": "error" } }
  }
}
```

